# ==========================================================
# FRONTEND PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT
# ==========================================================

# NORMAL STATIC DEPLOYMENT (recommended):
# No frontend environment variables are required.
# Build with `npm run build` and publish the `dist` directory.
# Configure the hosting platform to proxy `/api/*` to the live backend URL.
# Do not put database URLs, CSRF secrets, or passwords in frontend variables.

# ONLY IF THE HOST RUNS `npm run preview` AS A SERVER:
# Uncomment this variable and replace the value with the live backend origin.
# Do not add `/api` and do not add a trailing slash.
# API_PROXY_TARGET=https://CHANGE_ME_BACKEND_URL

# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY; DO NOT USE THIS VALUE IN PRODUCTION:
# API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:4000
